# Arm, then confirm. Price flushes to a new low — that alone is just a
# falling knife, so it only arms the idea. The trade needs momentum to
# turn within the next five bars; if it doesn't, the window closes and
# nothing happens. Written as one line instead of the pending-state
# bookkeeping this pattern usually costs, and the language still has no
# way to peek at a bar that hasn't closed.

strategy "Sweep Then Reclaim"

universe [sp_top_30]
timeframe 1d

when [new_low 20] then within 5 bars [macd_cross_up]
  buy [risk 1%]

sell when [rsi] > 65
  or [stop 2 atr]
  or [after 20 bars]

risk [max_positions 5]
